 "en-US-JennyNeural\u0000At checkout, a guest looks at the bill and frowns. “This is wrong,” she says. “There's a charge for the minibar, but I never touched it.” The charge is on the bill, but the guest is sure she did not use the minibar, and she is starting to feel upset.":{f:"50208b79cedf5a15",d:16.584,v:0.735,a:0.160,b:15.600,wd:[0.2, 0.38, 1.04, 1.16, 1.56, 1.88, 2.03, 2.32, 2.68, 2.82, 3.31, 3.68, 3.8, 4.35, 4.68, 4.96, 5.51, 5.63, 6.06, 6.36, 6.55, 7.04, 7.34, 7.46, 7.83, 8.32, 8.64, 8.76, 9.29, 9.48, 9.66, 10.0, 10.27, 10.4, 10.76, 11.13, 11.36, 11.61, 11.86, 12.1, 12.35, 12.59, 12.83, 13.38, 13.63, 13.96, 13.98, 14.6, 14.79, 15.09],e:"00000eiEIMVbG0RZQNLE000000XJ0bqUIG0DXP0EHVE0TH0VZVSPONLD00UUPNKIIG0HIE0000000000000000000000000gtOOPeNHJUdaXUPKIIE000GLLePKMVeUPLKHFKJ0000000000000000000000000O-rUJeKEPEXfbQDI0RPNTQQUSUQGGWQNLJF00000cjgeXVZfGTV0GELR0GK0PQKE000000000000000000000000000gj0PFajiO0VXKWgXRTQFLZUSPMKG000000hO0gODWsfNGEDSMLNLJQWSQHKKKSEQPFPUTUIFKTQF0NTOPSRSOENXQNLHE000000DcWKPLYbWIJFEhfTMPNIELD00WTQOSI0EIEWPKH00000000000000000000000000",w:"00---eZK--cYe-TcUNIB-----+gGjYXX----KLq--PN-L58NQTKGPS8---JSWRIB31---------0000000000000000---jZV---U--L9GHKLNK849m-----Xy--+cZYOEK----------------000000000----UN--Ve---LLNI---KMbM87fVPX7oKLKJIDZo---QSRieBUV+ILW--eSg---UIHIW--------------------------WWg--JMMH-hm-vKKCNC1dPWXSKD9A-----PM-UY6idcc---Sc----GFJIo---RDWTECNPSXPKLN--SG5DbEXM9HMNLLH8a-----siE---TUW----NLKMbC3-P---ZYKEPEs---UVQNOh-------00000000000000000",r:"--000NSh00PTN0YPXejq000001LlITUU0000hgB00ce0gwtebYhlcZt000iZWajqy+000000000----------------000ISW000X00gslkhgehtxsF00000U3001PSTdnh0000000000000000---------0000Xe00WN000ggej000hfQftuMWcUuDhghijoSD000bZaJNqXW1jgV00NZL000XjkjW00000000000000000000000000WWL00iffk0KF06hhpep+OcVUZhosr00000cf0XTvJOPP000ZP0000lmijD000aoWYnpecZUchge00ZlwoQnUfskfeggktR000009Jn000YXV0000eghfQpy0c000SThncn9000XWbedK0000000-----------------"},
